  "items.weapon.enchantments.crystal.desc": "This powerful enchantment deals extra magic damage and enhances a weapon's value. However, the enchanted weapon can shatter if the crystals aren't repaired, or given time to self-repair.",
  "items.weapon.enchantments.crystal.desc_cracked": "This crystal weapon is cracking, it's at risk of permanently breaking!",
